      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7220238074155064479, guid: 0c720939dc1385d4ca753859d42b6af1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[0]'
      value: '"Oh Lost Souls gather this night , Be aware or you will get Blight
        !"'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7220238074155064479, guid: 0c720939dc1385d4ca753859d42b6af1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[1]'
      value: Greetings , Duchess ! . Quite a rare to sight isn't it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7220238074155064479, guid: 0c720939dc1385d4ca753859d42b6af1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[2]'
      value: Moving on to more important Matters , you have buisness here I assume?..
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7220238074155064479, guid: 0c720939dc1385d4ca753859d42b6af1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[3]'
      value: Let me walk u through the basics of Combat and Adventure.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7220238074155064479, guid: 0c720939dc1385d4ca753859d42b6af1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[4]'
      value: '"WASD" to move ,  "Lsheft" to Sprint  , "Lclick" to Attack and "Spacebar"
        to Dash.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7220238074155064479, guid: 0c720939dc1385d4ca753859d42b6af1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[5]'
      value: That is all the wisdom I can offer you this time ,  May the radiant
        Moonlight guide your lost soul.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
